.md
## Misc
### The Marquee element

This element is used to insert a scrolling area of text. You can control what happens when the text reaches the edges of its content area using its attributes:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
## Misc
### The Marquee element

This element is used to insert a scrolling area of text. You can control what happens when the text reaches the edges of its content area using its attributes:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.slide
# Title

<marquee>Hello World</marquee>

